# Line endings of the double-click launchers (docs/DESIGN.md §13), on every checkout and in the
# ZIP that GitHub makes: Windows' cmd.exe misreads a .bat with bare LF line endings, and bash
# fails on CR at line ends, which a Windows checkout would otherwise add to the shell scripts.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.command text eol=lf
